---
title: "referral system (Current Finance: Referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_qualified: is_qualified_to_create_referral_code(who)?
    q_check_qualified --> q_already: already qualified, return
    q_check_qualified --> q_calc_value: collateral_value_usd = coin_value(price, amount, decimals)
    q_calc_value --> q_increase: increase_usd_qualification(who, value)
    q_increase --> q_check_threshold: accumulated gte referrer_deposit_usd_threshold?
    q_check_threshold --> q_no: not yet qualified
    q_check_threshold --> q_yes: can now create referral code

    q_yes --> q_generate: generate_referral_code(random, who)
    q_generate --> q_store: code_owner[code] = who, referrer_code[who] = code

    q_store --> q_usage: track_flash_loan_usage(fee_coin, code, sender)
    q_usage --> q_lookup: resolve referral code to referrer
    q_lookup --> q_calc_rebate: referrer_rebate = fee * referrer_discount_bps / 10000
    q_calc_rebate --> q_calc_referee: referee_rebate = fee * referee_discount_bps / 10000
    q_calc_referee --> q_accrue_referrer: accrue rebate for referrer
    q_accrue_referrer --> q_return_referee: return fee_coin minus referee_rebate
    q_return_referee --> [*]
    q_no --> [*]
    q_already --> [*]

    note right of q_usage
        INV-001: Referral code is 6 characters, randomly generated
        INV-002: Once referee binds to a code, binding is permanent
        INV-003: referrer_discount_bps and referee_discount_bps configurable by admin
        INV-004: Rebates accumulate in rebates Bag, claimable separately
        INV-005: Referral qualification requires USD threshold of flash loan volume
    end note
